dsh-ag-ui README · Browser Tool broker：`dsh-ag-ui/browser-tools` hides provider-safe name checks, object-rooted schema validation, exact Agent-scope registration, catalog replacement, collisions, cancellation, timeout, and lease teardown behind one interface. A caller owns Agent selection and transport:

```ts
const lease = ctx.browserTools.bind(agent, owner, tools, {
  invoke: (call, signal) => browserTransport.invoke(call, signal),
})

